#ASSERT (`the rate on` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `a Solitaire cardmember electing Dining and Family` `a month with nothing spent yet` `UOB FAQ Q17 -- groceries at MCC 5411, inside Family`)'s `miles per dollar` EQUALS 4
